msgstr "检测到电磁炮故障。开始自动修复。"

#: slot/0x00472837/0x0a7cd6/0x00000c
msgid "Radome damage detected. Evasion ability reduced."
msgstr "检测到雷达罩受损。回避能力下降。"

#: slot/0x00472837/0x0a7cd6/0x00000f
